 Instrument (Accordion);44g 6s 3c;26g 4s 7c; A portable wind instrument with a keyboard and bellows, producing sound by pressing keys and squeezing the bellows.;Musical Instrument (Trumpet);23g 6s 4c;18g 2s 8c; A brass instrument with a narrow tube and flared bell, played by buzzing the lips into a mouthpiece.;Musical Instrument (Tuba);99g 5s 4c;76g 4s 7c; A large brass instrument with a wide tube and flared bell, played by buzzing the lips into a mouthpiece.;Onyx Goblet;21g 9s 1c;16g 8s 1c;--;Orb of Timekeeping;124g 9c;108g 7s 8c; A crystal orb that accurately measures time, perfect for keeping track of hours and days.;Potion of Flying;728g 3s 8c;560g 4s 6c;This potion grants the ability to fly for a limited duration when consumed.;Ring of Kalecgos;22547g 4c;18288g 9c;Legen has it that this ring was forged in the burning breathe of the legendary dragon Kalecgos in his last moments of existance.;Ring of Keys;4780g 3c;3085g 8s 4c;This golden ring appears non-magical at first glance. While wearing it, you can use your action to touch an object andseak the command word to unlock any mundane lock.;Ring of the Ram (26 of 50 charges);5199g 3s 1c;3520g;A faceted ring, inlaid with diamond (design provides clue to function);Rod of extend metamagic (lesser);2731g 9s 3c;1823g 4s 2c;"This heavy ash rod once belonged to the dwarf adventurer Rida Heredotr, who vanished in the Lost Chambers of the Wraith Countess.";Rod of the Python;17031g 5s 4c;14646g 6s 3c;This heavy rod also emits a thin ray of red light upon command. (inscription provides clue to function);Rune-etched Gauntlets;169g 5s 3c;140g 7s 5c; Gauntlets inscribed with ancient runes that enhance the wearer's strength and combat prowess.;Sack of Apples;5g 2s 6c;4g 2s;50 lb.Can be bought in fractions. 1g = 10 lb.;Staff of Healing (25 of 50 charges);17461g 5s 6c;14168g 9s 9c;This heavy staff is said to be imbued with thesirit of the halfling artificer Ilin Derhin, who slew the Leviathan of the Sea of Thieves.;Staff of Power;50780g 9c;38933g 8s 7c;This staff is imbued with formidable magical energies, capable of unleashing devastating spells.;White Onyx;41g 8s 9c;30g 5s;--;yellow Quartz;38g 1s 3c;28g 6s 5c;--
